Description: Provides tools for estimating causal effects when an event
    occurs while a survey is in the field. The workflow models
    the unobserved no-event outcome path, evaluates short-horizon forecasts
    with rolling pre-event exercises, and reports inference that accounts for
    sampling uncertainty and bounded forecast misspecification.
